    return `<section class="ls-workflow-card ls-settings-pane" data-settings-pane="mode" aria-label="运行模式">
      <div class="ls-workflow-row"><span class="ls-workflow-label">状态处理</span><button class="ls-workflow-button" type="button" data-action="workflow-inline" aria-pressed="${String(!external)}">内置</button><button class="ls-workflow-button" type="button" data-action="workflow-external" aria-pressed="${String(external)}">外接 API</button></div>
      ${external ? buildIndependentSettingsMarkup() : ''}
      ${external ? `<div class="ls-workflow-row"><span class="ls-workflow-label">后台分析</span><button class="ls-workflow-button" type="button" data-action="external-background" aria-pressed="${runtime.externalBackgroundEnabled}" ${runtime.externalFlushPromise ? 'disabled' : ''}>${runtime.externalBackgroundEnabled ? '开' : '关'}</button></div><p class="ls-external-hint">开启后，分析时可以继续写正文；新楼层自动累计，每次最多合并三轮。正文暂用最近有效状态。已开启的前置推演仍需等待。</p><div class="ls-workflow-row ls-external-frequency"><span class="ls-workflow-label">更新频率</span><button class="ls-workflow-button" type="button" data-action="external-every-1" aria-pressed="${String(runtime.externalUpdateEvery !== 3)}" ${backgroundJob ? 'disabled' : ''}>每楼更新</button><button class="ls-workflow-button" type="button" data-action="external-every-3" aria-pressed="${String(runtime.externalUpdateEvery === 3)}" ${backgroundJob ? 'disabled' : ''}>三楼一更</button><button class="ls-workflow-button" type="button" data-action="external-update-now" ${pendingCount && (!runtime.externalFlushPromise || (backgroundJob && backgroundJob.rangeStart == null)) ? '' : 'disabled'}>立即更新</button></div><p class="ls-external-hint">立即更新以点击时已完成的楼层为截止，后台处理，不等待凑满三轮。</p>${backgroundProgress ? `<p class="ls-external-hint" role="status">${escapeHtml(backgroundProgress)}</p>` : ''}
      <div data-draft-key="external-range"><details class="ls-api-advanced ls-external-range"><summary>指定区间补算</summary><p class="ls-external-hint">填写酒馆楼号，只补算待更新正文；已更新的楼层会跳过。不能跳过更早的待更新内容，也不会覆盖已结算的历史。自动分批，最后不足三轮也会处理。</p><div class="ls-workflow-row"><label style="flex:1;min-width:100px">起始楼<input class="ls-external-input ls-range-start" type="number" min="0" step="1" inputmode="numeric" value="${escapeHtml(runtime.externalRange.start)}"></label><label style="flex:1;min-width:100px">结束楼<input class="ls-external-input ls-range-end" type="number" min="0" step="1" inputmode="numeric" value="${escapeHtml(runtime.externalRange.end)}"></label><button class="ls-workflow-button" data-action="external-range-start" ${runtime.externalFlushPromise ? 'disabled' : ''}>分析此区间</button></div><p class="ls-external-hint" role="status">${escapeHtml(runtime.externalRange.error || runtime.externalRange.message)}</p></details></div>` : ''}
      ${external ? `<div class="ls-workflow-row ls-external-stop-row"><button class="ls-workflow-button" type="button" data-action="external-stop-inline" ${runtime.generationActive || runtime.externalControl.stopping ? 'disabled' : ''}>${runtime.externalControl.stopping ? '正在停止外接…' : '停止外接并切回内置'}</button>${runtime.generationActive ? '<small>本轮正文结束后可停止外接</small>' : ''}</div>` : ''}
      ${external ? `<div class="ls-external-row">${independentAnalysisActive() ? '' : `<button class="ls-workflow-button" type="button" data-action="external-preflight" aria-pressed="${String(runtime.externalPreflightEnabled)}" title="只有勾选后才会在正文生成前调用一次 API">前置推演 ${runtime.externalPreflightEnabled ? '●' : '○'}</button>`}<span class="ls-external-status" data-level="${runtime.externalStatus === 'error' || runtime.externalContentFilterNotice ? 'error' : 'normal'}">${escapeHtml(statusLabels[runtime.externalStatus] || statusLabels.idle)}${pendingCount > 0 ? ` · 待结算 ${pendingCount} 轮` : ''}${runtime.externalContentFilterNotice ? ` · ${escapeHtml(runtime.externalContentFilterNotice)}` : ''}</span>${pendingCount > 0 && runtime.externalStatus === 'error' ? '<button class="ls-workflow-button" type="button" data-action="external-retry">重试全部</button>' : ''}<button class="ls-workflow-button" type="button" data-action="external-response" ${runtime.externalLastResponse ? '' : 'disabled'}>查看返回</button></div>` : ''}
      <div class="ls-settings-links"><button class="ls-workflow-button" type="button" data-action="settings-page" data-settings-page="api">配置外接 API →</button><button class="ls-workflow-button" type="button" data-action="settings-page" data-settings-page="cleaning">检查正文清理 →</button></div>
    </section>
    <section class="ls-workflow-card ls-settings-pane" data-settings-pane="api" aria-label="外接 API"><p class="ls-external-hint">此连接供外接分析、正文清理等功能共用。配置或测试不会切换运行模式。</p><div class="ls-external-connection-row"><span class="ls-transport-status" role="status">${config.model ? `模型：${escapeHtml(config.model)}` : '尚未配置模型'} · ${transportLabel}</span>${transportStatus.usingFallback ? '<button class="ls-workflow-button" type="button" data-action="external-reset-transport">下次先直连</button>' : ''}</div>${settings}</section>
    <section class="ls-workflow-card ls-settings-pane" data-settings-pane="cleaning" aria-label="正文清理"><p class="ls-external-hint">建议先检查正文，再启用外接分析。当前使用已保存的外接连接；只处理发送给外接模型的副本，不改聊天原文。</p><button class="ls-workflow-button" type="button" data-action="settings-page" data-settings-page="api">配置外接 API →</button>${buildExternalCleaningMarkup()}</section>
    <section class="ls-workflow-card ls-display-settings ls-settings-pane" data-settings-pane="appearance" aria-label="界面外观">
      <div class="ls-workflow-row ls-display-row"><span class="ls-workflow-label">状态显示</span><button class="ls-workflow-button" type="button" data-action="display-floating" aria-pressed="${String(runtime.displayMode === DISPLAY_MODES.FLOATING)}">悬浮</button><button class="ls-workflow-button" type="button" data-action="display-inline" aria-pressed="${String(runtime.displayMode === DISPLAY_MODES.INLINE)}">正文下</button></div>
      <div class="ls-workflow-row ls-floating-entry-row"><span class="ls-workflow-label">桌面悬浮入口</span><button class="ls-workflow-button" type="button" data-action="floating-entry-bar" aria-pressed="${runtime.floatingEntry !== 'icon'}">横条</button><button class="ls-workflow-button" type="button" data-action="floating-entry-icon" aria-pressed="${runtime.floatingEntry === 'icon'}">小图标</button></div><p class="ls-external-hint">只改变桌面悬浮窗收起后的样式；手机和正文下模式仍使用小图标。点击展开，按住可拖动。</p>
